# This tool is token-less — there are NO secrets to configure.
# Usage data is pushed in by the cursor-usage-bridge extension/bookmarklet,
# which runs on cursor.com using your existing browser session.
#
# The only (optional) knob is the port. It MUST match the bridge's ingest URL
# (default http://127.0.0.1:8799/ingest). Copy to .env only if you need to change it.
#
# PORT=8799
